# Zig tooling normalises to LF: `zig fmt --check` fails on CRLF source, and
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise hand a fresh Windows clone CRLF files.
*.zig text eol=lf
*.zon text eol=lf
# The generated C is compared byte for byte with what the generator writes, and
# the shaders are GLSL that `glslc` turns into the .spv beside them.
*.c text eol=lf
*.vert text eol=lf
*.frag text eol=lf
*.spv binary
